 namespace {
 
+// Kute: the exclusive access bubble ("Press Esc to exit full screen", "Press
+// Esc to show your cursor") is a software overlay over the game. On Wayland
+// and X11 compositors it blocks direct scanout and tearing while it shows.
+// Kute's F11 goes through Chrome's fullscreen controller and the game locks
+// the pointer on every spawn. Enabled by Kute with
+// --enable-features=KuteNoExclusiveAccessBubble.
+BASE_FEATURE(kKuteNoExclusiveAccessBubble,
+             "KuteNoExclusiveAccessBubble",
+             base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
+
 // The visible height of the shadow above the tabs. Clicks in this area are
